SCE TMS Mobile application is used for trading partners of Maersk is created specifically for delivery services. The new order management application is designed to use with Logistics web-service on the part of couriers and drivers.


With SCE TMS Mobile installed your smartphone becomes the point where the office encounters the field.

- View the list of shipments and detailed information on each;

- Track and evaluate Pickup and Delivery progress;

- Observe Shipment/Orders and estimated routes on the map;

- Make a detailed route to an order using external navigational applications;

- Assign status to each shipment

- Confirm delivery by attaching a photo with customer signature to an order with data on customer name, delivery time and date indicated on a photo;

- Option to use your smartphone as a tracker.

We offer advanced courier assistant on every stage of delivery.

Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.
